# ALONG A WALL, CLOSE (found.gdshader `found_stipple`, matter.gdshaderinc's
# ruled heights): the patterns a surface is drawn in, seen at a grazing angle
# from over the shoulder, must not beat against the pixels.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/grazing.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is a house's wall seen nearly edge-on from beside it; 02 the same turned
# the other way along it.
coast calm
near house
wait 0.6
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
mouse 560,0 0.6
wait 1.0
shot 01-along-a-house-wall with shoulder
mouse -1120,0 0.8
wait 1.0
shot 02-along-it-the-other-way with shoulder
